  "description": "Despite his hard work, Lee Eunho finds himself laid off due to company downsizing. Before he can even consider what's next, ominous messages appear, claiming Earth has been bought out. Now, only survivors of life-or-death missions will make the cut, turning even friends into foes. As all hell breaks loose, humanity must decide between using one another to get ahead or working together as a team. Can Eunho survive Earth's sudden downsizing, or will the pressure to move up leave him in the dust?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
